#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The examples in this section illustrate some common ways to use the Executor primitive. Before running these examples, follow the instructions in [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) and [Executor quickstart](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
msgstr "Contoh-contoh dalam bahagian ini menggambarkan beberapa cara biasa untuk menggunakan primitif Executor. Sebelum menjalankan contoh-contoh ini, ikuti arahan dalam [Pasang Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) dan [Quickstart Executor](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum bermula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some of the code examples on this page use `samplex`, which is part of the Samplomatic package.  Therefore, before running those code block, you must install Samplomatic, as shown in the following code block.  For more information, see the [Samplomatic documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"
msgstr "Beberapa contoh kod di halaman ini menggunakan `samplex`, yang merupakan sebahagian daripada pakej Samplomatic. Oleh itu, sebelum menjalankan blok kod tersebut, anda mesti memasang Samplomatic, seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam blok kod berikut. Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [dokumentasi Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Parameterized circuit {#example-parameterized-circuit}"
msgstr "Contoh: Litar berparameter {#example-parameterized-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example illustrates how to add circuit items with parameters, as well as how to add samplex items. It consists of these steps:\n"
"1. Set up the circuit: Generate and transpile the target circuit.\n"
"2. Prepare a samplex: Group gates and measurements into annotated boxes and generate the circuit template and samplex pair.\n"
"3. Execute: Add a circuit item and a samplex item to a `QuantumProgram` and execute both in a single job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menggambarkan cara menambah item litar dengan parameter, serta cara menambah item samplex. Ia terdiri daripada langkah-langkah berikut:\n"
"1. Sediakan litar: Jana dan transpile litar sasaran.\n"
"2. Sediakan samplex: Kumpulkan gate dan pengukuran ke dalam kotak beranotasi dan jana pasangan templat litar dan samplex.\n"
"3. Laksanakan: Tambah item litar dan item samplex ke `QuantumProgram` dan laksanakan kedua-duanya dalam satu kerja.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the circuit {#set-up-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Sediakan litar {#set-up-the-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a three-qubit GHZ state, rotate the qubits around the Pauli-Z axis, and measures the qubits in the computational basis.\n"
msgstr "Sediakan keadaan GHZ tiga qubit, putarkan qubit di sekitar paksi Pauli-Z, dan ukur qubit dalam asas pengkomputeran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify the backend and transpile the circuit to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as an instruction set architecture (ISA) circuit).\n"
msgstr "Tentukan Backend dan transpile litar agar hanya menggunakan arahan yang disokong oleh QPU (dirujuk sebagai litar seni bina set arahan (ISA)).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the samplex {#prepare-the-samplex}"
msgstr "Sediakan samplex {#prepare-the-samplex}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `generate_boxing_pass_manager` convenience function and its twirling parameters to group two-qubit gates and measurements into boxes and apply twirling annotations.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan fungsi kemudahan `generate_boxing_pass_manager` dan parameter twirling-nya untuk mengumpulkan gate dua qubit dan pengukuran ke dalam kotak dan menerapkan anotasi twirling.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `build` method to generate the template circuit and the samplex.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan kaedah `build` untuk menjana templat litar dan samplex.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the circuits {#execute-the-circuits}"
msgstr "Laksanakan litar {#execute-the-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Executor runs `QuantumProgram` objects. Each `QuantumProgram` can contain several items. This example adds a circuit item and a samplex item for execution. For full details, see [Executor input and output](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"
msgstr "Executor menjalankan objek `QuantumProgram`. Setiap `QuantumProgram` boleh mengandungi beberapa item. Contoh ini menambah item litar dan item samplex untuk dilaksanakan. Untuk butiran lengkap, lihat [Input dan output Executor](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first step is to initialize an empty program, requesting `1024` shots for each configuration of each item.\n"
msgstr "Langkah pertama adalah memulakan program kosong, meminta `1024` shots untuk setiap konfigurasi setiap item.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Append the circuit item to the `QuantumProgram`. This circuit item consists of two parts - the ISA circuit and 10 sets of its parameter values.\n"
msgstr "Tambah item litar ke `QuantumProgram`. Item litar ini terdiri daripada dua bahagian - litar ISA dan 10 set nilai parameternya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Append the samplex item to the `QuantumProgram` with these arguments:\n"
"- The template circuit and the samplex generated by the `build` function\n"
"- Ten sets of parameter values for the original circuit\n"
"- The number of randomizations to perform\n"
msgstr ""
"Tambah item samplex ke `QuantumProgram` dengan argumen-argumen ini:\n"
"- Templat litar dan samplex yang dijana oleh fungsi `build`\n"
"- Sepuluh set nilai parameter untuk litar asal\n"
"- Bilangan pengacakan yang akan dilakukan\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Executor job {#run-the-executor-job}"
msgstr "Jalankan kerja Executor {#run-the-executor-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve the result for each task.\n"
msgstr "Dapatkan semula keputusan untuk setiap tugas.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Perform PEC {#example-perform-pec}"
msgstr "Contoh: Lakukan PEC {#example-perform-pec}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example shows how to use a samplex item to perform probabilistic error cancellation ([PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pec)) for error mitigation.\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan item samplex untuk melakukan pembatalan ralat berkemungkinan ([PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pec)) bagi mitigasi ralat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consider a mirrored-version of a circuit with ten qubits and two unique layers of CX gates. These are the main tasks:\n"
"- Execute the circuit with twirling.\n"
"- Execute the circuit with PEC mitigation, as in the paper [\"Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli-Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertimbangkan versi litar bercermin dengan sepuluh qubit dan dua lapisan unik gate CX. Tugas-tugas utamanya adalah:\n"
"- Laksanakan litar dengan twirling.\n"
"- Laksanakan litar dengan mitigasi PEC, seperti dalam kertas kerja [\"Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli-Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The pipeline consists of these steps:\n"
"1. Set up: Generate the target circuit and group its operations into boxes.\n"
"2. Learn: Learn the noise of the instructions that we want to mitigate with PEC.\n"
"3. Execute: Run the circuit on a backend.\n"
"4. Analyze: Post-process and analyze the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saluran paip terdiri daripada langkah-langkah berikut:\n"
"1. Persediaan: Jana litar sasaran dan kumpulkan operasinya ke dalam kotak.\n"
"2. Pembelajaran: Pelajari hingar arahan yang ingin kita mitigasi dengan PEC.\n"
"3. Pelaksanaan: Jalankan litar pada Backend.\n"
"4. Analisis: Proses pasca dan analisis keputusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For comparison, we will run this mirrored circuit twice. Once with only Pauli-twirling applied, and once withe PEC mitigation applied.\n"
msgstr "Untuk perbandingan, kita akan menjalankan litar bercermin ini dua kali. Sekali dengan hanya twirling Pauli yang diterapkan, dan sekali dengan mitigasi PEC yang diterapkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The usage for this example is approximately 10 minutes on a Heron r2 processor.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Penggunaan untuk contoh ini adalah lebih kurang 10 minit pada pemproses Heron r2.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the circuit {#set-up-the-circuit-1}"
msgstr "Sediakan litar {#set-up-the-circuit-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend and prepare a 10-qubit circuit.\n"
msgstr "Pilih Backend dan sediakan litar 10-qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f9e93b2c-154a-4d09-872d-f770bcc669c4-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f9e93b2c-154a-4d09-872d-f770bcc669c4-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combine the circuit with its inverse to create a mirror circuit.\n"
msgstr "Gabungkan litar dengan inversnya untuk mencipta litar bercermin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f8ac3f75-88ca-40f9-8382-6a427303bb8e-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f8ac3f75-88ca-40f9-8382-6a427303bb8e-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set some parameter values:\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan beberapa nilai parameter:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the pass manager to transpile the circuit to become an ISA circuit.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan pengurus pas untuk mentranspile litar agar menjadi litar ISA.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, group gates and measurements into annotated boxes. You can do this manually or use the `generate_boxing_pass_manager` function from Samplomatic for convenience. The first circuit will only have twirling applied and therefore only needs the `Twirl` annotation. The second circuit will be run with full PEC mitigation and needs both `Twirl` and `InjectNoise` annotations.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, kumpulkan gate dan pengukuran ke dalam kotak beranotasi. Anda boleh melakukan ini secara manual atau menggunakan fungsi `generate_boxing_pass_manager` daripada Samplomatic untuk kemudahan. Litar pertama hanya akan diterapkan twirling dan oleh itu hanya memerlukan anotasi `Twirl`. Litar kedua akan dijalankan dengan mitigasi PEC penuh dan memerlukan kedua-dua anotasi `Twirl` dan `InjectNoise`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise {#learn-the-noise}"
msgstr "Pelajari hingar {#learn-the-noise}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To minimize the number of noise learning experiments, identify the unique instructions in the second circuit (the one with boxes annotated with `InjectNoise`). In defining uniqueness, two box instructions are equal if both of the following are true:\n"
"- Their content is equal, up to single-qubit gates.\n"
"- Their `Twirl` annotation is equal (every other annotation is disregarded).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk meminimumkan bilangan eksperimen pembelajaran hingar, kenal pasti arahan unik dalam litar kedua (yang mempunyai kotak beranotasi dengan `InjectNoise`). Dalam menentukan keunikan, dua arahan kotak adalah sama jika kedua-dua perkara berikut adalah benar:\n"
"- Kandungannya adalah sama, sehingga gate satu qubit.\n"
"- Anotasi `Twirl`-nya adalah sama (setiap anotasi lain diabaikan).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This leads to three unique instructions, namely the odd and even gate boxes, and the final measurement box.\n"
msgstr "Ini menghasilkan tiga arahan unik, iaitu kotak gate ganjil dan genap, serta kotak pengukuran akhir.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize a `NoiseLearnerV3`, choose the learning parameters by setting its options, and run a noise learning job.\n"
msgstr "Inisialisasikan `NoiseLearnerV3`, pilih parameter pembelajaran dengan menetapkan pilihan-pilihannya, dan jalankan kerja pembelajaran hingar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert `result` to the object required by the samplex by using the `result.to_dict` method.\n"
msgstr "Tukar `result` kepada objek yang diperlukan oleh samplex menggunakan kaedah `result.to_dict`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the circuits {#execute-the-circuits-1}"
msgstr "Laksanakan litar-litar {#execute-the-circuits-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Executor` runs `QuantumProgram` objects. Each `QuantumProgram` can contain several *items*, which are appended to the program. Each item is a task for the program to perform.\n"
msgstr "`Executor` menjalankan objek `QuantumProgram`. Setiap `QuantumProgram` boleh mengandungi beberapa *item*, yang ditambahkan ke program. Setiap item adalah satu tugas untuk program dilaksanakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize an empty program, requesting `1000` shots for each configuration of each item.\n"
msgstr "Inisialisasikan program kosong, meminta `1000` shots untuk setiap konfigurasi setiap item.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, build the template circuit and samplex for `mirror_circuit_twirl` and append them to the program. Also request `900` randomizations from the samplex. This means that the samplex will generate `900` sets of parameters, and each set will be executed `1000` times (the number of shots) in the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, bina templat litar dan samplex untuk `mirror_circuit_twirl` dan tambahkannya ke program. Juga minta `900` pengacakan daripada samplex. Ini bermakna samplex akan menjana `900` set parameter, dan setiap set akan dilaksanakan sebanyak `1000` kali (bilangan shots) dalam QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the program's first task (result 0).\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah tugas pertama program (keputusan 0).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similarly, append the template circuit and samplex built for `mirror_circuit_pec`, requesting `900` randomizations.  This is the program's second task (result 1).\n"
msgstr "Begitu juga, tambahkan templat litar dan samplex yang dibina untuk `mirror_circuit_pec`, meminta `900` pengacakan. Ini adalah tugas kedua program (keputusan 1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import `Executor` and submit a job.\n"
msgstr "Import `Executor` dan hantar kerja.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze results {#analyze-results}"
msgstr "Analisis keputusan {#analyze-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, post-process the results to estimate the expectation values of single-qubit Pauli-Z operators acting on each of the ten active qubits (expected value: `1.0`).\n"
msgstr "Akhirnya, proses pasca keputusan untuk menganggarkan nilai jangkaan operator Pauli-Z satu qubit yang bertindak pada setiap sepuluh qubit aktif (nilai jangkaan: `1.0`).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

