"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Semak gambaran keseluruhan [broadcasting](/guides/primitive-input-output#broadcasting).\n"
"- Ketahui cara menggunakan [pilihan Executor](/guides/executor-options).\n"
"- Fahami [model pelaksanaan terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"- Semak [dokumentasi Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/).\n"
